xe etc) are use with ammo system:<br><br><br>- Monsters are procedurally generated, for exemple if you meet that kind of boss again, it may not be exactly the same,<br><br>There gonna be several species of enemies, including Dragons of course, but also Titans, Giant Insects, Krakens and so.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683640/extras/c8b45bb2a09e22ea1109178b74fad7e5.poster.avif?t=1710318293\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683640/extras/c8b45bb2a09e22ea1109178b74fad7e5.webm?t=1710318293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683640/extras/c8b45bb2a09e22ea1109178b74fad7e5.mp4?t=1710318293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>- There will be 3 independant complete run in total (not only one !) you will unlock one by one.<br><br>- Plus : there will be 3 difficulty modes so to increase replayability again.",
